text:
You've seen Jev all over your timeline. Here's the move.

@typesafeai + AgentMail = a full email team for your one-person business. Sales, support, BDR, security. Each with their own inbox.

Here's the cookbook. https://t.co/F8P5vTocVH

Apify handles the data, Jev does the scoring.

@svpino paired Apify Web Fetch with Jev to score 1,000 hotel reviews by WiFI and noise, instead of relying solely on star ratings. 

Watch the full run below 👇

We recently shared what happens when you pair JEV with SERV, so it was great to see someone in the first SERV Hackathon actually building with the combination.

@Timidan_x built Tern, using SERV to reason over untrusted information, a Shadow Agent to review the reasoning trace, and JEV to score it before moving forward.

Love seeing builders already experimenting with different parts of the SERV stack together in real agentic workflows.
